WEBVTT

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.840
How long are you going to hide for?

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.010
That jerk!

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.850
Ingrid mentioned a resonance...

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:28.270
Yui!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.770
Are you okay?

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.860
Rena!

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.070
Wake up! Rena!

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:24.390
Kei is here?!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:32.520
Rena! Rena!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.980
Are you okay, Rena?

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.190
Kei is...

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.950
Tia! Can you hear me?

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:39.820
Yeah.

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.530
We've got to help Kei!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.830
That over there-it's not the real Kei!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.580
It isn't?

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.080
What do you mean?

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:50.580
I don't know...

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:55.290
But I think that Kei is
inside of us... Inside Erinius.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.430
Hmm? Where'd you run off to?

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.310
Rena! Let's help Kei.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:11.020
But you won't be able to use
Alecto's powers by yourself.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.770
It's okay. Go, help her.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.360
I'll do my best.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.650
Okay.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:52.890
Rena! I finally found you!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.020
Is Kei in here?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.860
Yes. She must be.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.960
What'll we do, Yui?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.960
Sara, bear with me for a second.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.090
Huh?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.510
Wow, this thing is huge!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.510
I wonder if she's in here...

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.350
Aah! What's going on?!

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.780
What-- Huh?

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:48.740
Let's go.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:51.950
Huh? Hang on, Rena!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.090
I can't tell where they
are with all this smoke...

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.510
Hmm? Found you!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.050
Whoops... Too bad.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.260
Yui!

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:22.480
You...!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.840
All right! Way to go, Yui!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:56.680
Is this... Rimgarde?

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.070
Kei...

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.700
What are you doing out here, all alone?

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.580
Do you want to come with me?

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.710
Ingrid...

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.750
Is that okay, Abel?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.890
It looks great on you.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.850
Really?

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:47.320
These are Kei's memories...

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.070
It's so beautiful!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.870
And this all looks really good!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.000
It's delicious!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.510
Thank you so much for coming, Princess Ingrid.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.350
It's my pleasure. So...

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.140
Yes, let me introduce you.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:19.770
There he is.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.900
Hello, Princess Ingrid.
My name is Johann.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.990
Hello, Johann.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:41.000
It truly is an honor to meet you.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:45.540
Now you've done it.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.110
It's Alecto!

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.870
This way is much faster.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:23.080
It can't be helped. It's what
you wanted, after all.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.550
Tisis has appeared!

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.420
It has made contact with Alecto
and they're now locked in combat!

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.260
Lured right out, weren't you?

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:49.190
It has surpassed the resonance critical limit!

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.610
What in the...?!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.910
I told you to take it slow, didn't I?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.290
What is going on here?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.880
Ingrid...

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.860
The Fall of Rimgarde...

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:49.710
Kei...

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:05.930
Hey, Empress...

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:09.350
Look at you. Why are you
still sticking your neck out?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.690
It's got nothing to do with you...

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:15.280
Nothing to do with me?! You're wrong!

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:18.530
No, it really doesn't concern you.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:22.200
This is our problem.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.620
Johann...

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.560
What a foolish country.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:58.070
If they had just done as I said,
none of this would have happened.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.910
Oh, you're scaring me! Help, Kei!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.250
Kei...

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.210
Thanks to those fools,
we've got to start all over.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:17.590
I'll be taking her to start.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:21.050
Johann! What do you want with Kei?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:25.760
She's my little doll now.
She can't hear your voice anymore.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.020
Kei!

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.980
You're free to come along.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.940
After all, these terrible things
wouldn't be happening to her

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.360
if you hadn't picked her up.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.730
It was you?

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:15.560
You were the one who did those
terrible things to Ingrid and Kei.

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:21.280
So what? It's got nothing
to do with you, Princess.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:24.860
Just leave your friends here,
go back to your castle, and keep quiet.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:30.780
I care about them!
I can't leave my friends behind!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.750
Oh, really? Well, I'm afraid I have
business with them. Too bad.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:43.840
How... How can you be so cruel?!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:48.810
You must have someone you care about, too!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:59.150
Kei! Kei!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.360
Kei...

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.570
What'll we do, Rena?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:12.700
The three Regalia of Erinius are together.
We can cause a resonance.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.120
Resonance...

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.230
You can die now.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.170
Yui!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:04.630
You're the only one that is really unnecessary.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.840
So you're the only one that will die.

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:58.430
Bye, now... Empress of Enastoria.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.740
Huh? Isn't it a little too soon for your betrayal?

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.950
Kei is still my doll, you know.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:30.340
You carried the burden for
all that the foolish king

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:35.050
and his scientists did. You bore it
and bore it, waiting for your chance...

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.560
And now this?

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:40.890
I don't need your sympathy!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.520
Oh... Is that so?

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:46.520
Yui!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.450
I already know!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.950
You planned to kill me once you took back Kei.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:06.170
I guess you planned to take her
back using Erinius' resonance...

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:08.210
Too bad.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.220
Kei.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.280
Ingrid...

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.120
It's been fun.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.960
Ingrid...

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.260
Bye.

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:56.860
I'm back, Ingrid.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.290
Ingrid...

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.960
Welcome home, Kei.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.350
You saved Kei, didn't you?

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.350
Yeah.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:27.810
I did my best while you were gone, big sis.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.230
Yeah.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.150
I don't really get it, but this is great!

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.610
It's great!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:39.530
Oh, my... Does this mean
that the tables have turned?

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:46.070
Kei! We're gonna take that
big jerk down for you!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.330
I won't let him get away with this.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.420
Thanks, you two. But you see...

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:59.590
We have been eagerly
awaiting this day for 12 years.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.010
I'm terribly sorry, but would
you mind if we did the honors?

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.760
Let's go, Kei!

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:05.970
Okay.

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:16.230
It's been a while, Johann.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.780
Well, I've seen you every day.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:23.070
I can't believe you dared to lay a
finger on Ingrid and the others.

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:25.950
I will break you apart
until only particles remain.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.580
Hey, that's not funny.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.800
What was that?

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:48.020
How about this, then?

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.190
Oopsy.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.860
I'm not even breaking a sweat.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.280
Down you go.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:21.340
Man, she packs a punch!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:22.550
Huh?

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:26.220
This is for what you did to Yui!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.780
And this is for Sara!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:10.050
This is our rage! This is Rimgarde's rage!

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.980
In the name of Erinius,
Megaera will pierce through!

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:20.230
Judgment Arrow!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.710
That's it...

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.710
Ingrid...
